# Editorial notes for the 203 mechanics. Original explanations written for this project;
# they are not quotations or definitions from the book. Mechanic names/IDs come from the public index.
# Columns: id | play (agon alea mimicry ilinx, each 0-3) | summary | representative works (" / " separated)
# Works are illustrative (board games and video games), chosen by the editor. Blank = no confident example.
STR-01|3000|各プレイヤーが自分の勝利のために競い合う、最も基本的な構造。|チェス / カタン / Street Fighter 6
STR-02|2010|全員がゲームのシステムを相手に協力し、共に勝つか負ける。|パンデミック / Spirit Island / It Takes Two
STR-03|2010|チームに分かれ、チーム単位で勝敗を競う。|Codenames / コントラクトブリッジ / Counter-Strike 2
